  · Shoulder rotation with arm vertical – Gimbal lock in Euler representation (avoided by POE).

Redundancy null space: At non‑singular configurations, \dim \mathcal{N}(J) = 1. The null motion corresponds to the “elbow circle” – the elbow can move on a circle without moving the wrist.

